#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:5
#: 204b120736aa4c9f9d1c6407e7787cd1
msgid "Parameter Reset"
msgstr "参数重置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:7
#: 802bf3be62ab4093b03b58cf81c08f25
msgid ""
"This article shows several ways to reset all parameters to their default "
"values.If you would like to restore any of the existing setup parameters, "
"save them to a file first!"
msgstr "本文介绍将所有参数重置为默认值的几种方法。如果您希望保留现有设置参数，请先将其保存到文件！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:11
#: 6d916d1143ef47c582e6517deaf76ddf
msgid "Option #1: Using the Mission Planner"
msgstr "方法一：使用 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:13
#: 392a64b97048405cab266226086ad734
msgid ""
"Mission Planner has a dedicated **Reset to Default** button. This will reset"
" all parameters to the vehicle's defaults."
msgstr "Mission Planner 有专用的 **Reset to Default** 按钮。这将把所有参数重置为飞行器的默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:15
#: f95e0369c9e649c4bff885b20d5fe058
msgid ""
"It will not reset the DroneCAN dynamic node address table. The other "
"parameter reset methods listed below will also reset that table so that new "
"devices can use previous addresses of devices that are being replaced."
msgstr "此方法不会重置 DroneCAN 动态节点地址表。下面列出的其他参数重置方法也会重置该表，使新设备可以使用被替换设备的先前地址。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:17
#: 6583bc4fa9fe4e29a97541577d3afaed
msgid ""
"Connect the autopilot to *Mission Planner*, and on the **CONFIG \\| Full "
"Parameter List** or **Full Parameter Tree** page push the **Reset to "
"Default** button."
msgstr ""
"将飞控连接到 *Mission Planner*，在 **CONFIG \\| Full Parameter List** 或 **Full "
"Parameter Tree** 页面按 **Reset to Default** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:22
#: f7b7e6d04bed499aa81e93c55d7a6629
msgid ""
"The autopilot will automatically reboot, setting all parameters back to "
"their default values."
msgstr "飞控将自动重启，将所有参数恢复为默认值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:25
#: 5f5ad028e0d84bf4b5965b113cd5d5b1
msgid "Option #2: Change the FORMAT_VERSION parameter"
msgstr "方法二：修改 FORMAT_VERSION 参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:27
#: 60b1ef3aa9a94c5e89aa8bd1dc268a44
msgid ""
"On any Ground Control Station (that can write parameters) you can reset "
"parameters by setting the :ref:`FORMAT_VERSION<FORMAT_VERSION>`  parameter "
"to zero. After writing the parameter, reboot the board."
msgstr ""
"在任何地面控制站（能够写入参数的）上，您可以通过将 :ref:`FORMAT_VERSION<FORMAT_VERSION>` "
"参数设置为零来重置参数。写入参数后，重启板卡。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:32
#: a29d7e9d153b42278bf87aefd3cae071
msgid "Option #3: Load another vehicle's firmware"
msgstr "方法三：加载其他飞行器的固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:36
#: 4190983f965d4461b739e8ab7f69c881
msgid ""
"This method is not recommended because it's unnecessarily time consuming."
msgstr "不推荐此方法，因为它不必要地耗时。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:39
#: 1692487cada64b5290371316adf5d2bf
msgid ""
"Upload the firmware for a completely different vehicle type (I.e. if you "
"were using Copter, now upload the Rover firmware).  Reboot the board and let"
" it sit for 30 seconds to clear the EEPROM.  Then upload the original "
"firmware (i.e. Copter) to the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"上传完全不同飞行器类型的固件（例如，如果您使用的是 Copter，现在上传 Rover 固件）。重启板卡并等待 30 秒以清除 "
"EEPROM。然后将原始固件（即 Copter）上传到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:46
#: cbc835618c7f4551ac98dffaaa32cdcc
msgid "Restoring Calibrations after Resets"
msgstr "重置后恢复校准"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:48
#: 9b25994aa1e24720ae956c4ae26b661d
msgid ""
"The above will also reset the flag used to indicate that Accelerometer and "
"Compasses have been calibrated, so that even if you restore your old "
"parameters from a file, the calibrations would still need to be repeated."
msgstr "上述操作还会重置表示加速度计和罗盘已校准的标志位，因此即使您从文件中恢复旧参数，仍需重新进行校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:50
#: 8a197257a2244cf3be6bf801e55ce121
msgid "There are two methods to allow these to be restored."
msgstr "有两种方法可以恢复这些校准。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:52
#: eab3c4f4359941d585b162099255122f
msgid ""
"**Only use this method if you are certain that the Accelerometer or Compass "
"sensors have not changed in any manner since the parameters were stored in a"
" file. Restoring inaccurate calibration data can lead to a crash!**"
msgstr "**仅在确定自参数保存到文件以来加速度计或罗盘传感器没有以任何方式发生变化的情况下使用此方法。恢复不准确的校准数据可能导致坠机！**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:55
#: f4d0f8a88a884517a84cc9305ff90a06
msgid "Using Mission Planner"
msgstr "使用 Mission Planner"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:57
#: da71dc76f6d04ba59ec23a4ed8f68101
msgid "Press CTRL+F to get to advanced commands."
msgstr "按 CTRL+F 进入高级命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:59
#: 2bd535ab87474b93bc31de938f396e5c
msgid ""
"Now restore your previously stored parameters (could have also been done as "
"first step), which includes the calibration parameters, to the autopilot and"
" reboot. Calibration should not be required to arm now."
msgstr "现在将之前保存的参数（也可以作为第一步执行）恢复到飞控，其中包括校准参数，然后重启。此时应不再需要校准即可解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:61
#: 4af7a1a713b84168960b9ab5716f2dc6
msgid ""
"Press the \"Force Accel Cal\" and/or \"Force Compass Cal\" to set the flag "
"which indicates the cal has been done."
msgstr "按「Force Accel Cal」和/或「Force Compass Cal」以设置表示校准已完成的标志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:66
#: f72e632936b24166a12bb40ba3a640a8
msgid "Using MAVProxy"
msgstr "使用 MAVProxy"

#: ../../source/docs/common-parameter-reset.rst:68
#: 3a099592816f407a9cd3947ba0e490a8
msgid ""
"Simply type \"forcecal\" will force the autopilot into a calibrated state. "
"Be sure you have valid compass and IMU calibration values already loaded."
msgstr "只需输入「forcecal」即可强制飞控进入已校准状态。请确保已加载有效的罗盘和 IMU 校准值。"
